<urn:usf:requirement:grader-consults-no-model> <urn:usf:predicate:invariant> "no grader contacts a provider; model agreement is never admissible as evidence." <urn:usf:graph:provider-task-qualification> .
<urn:usf:requirement:grader-consults-no-model> <urn:usf:predicate:requirementSeverity> <urn:usf:requirement-severity:blocking> <urn:usf:graph:provider-task-qualification> .
