<urn:usf:requirement:grader-consults-no-model> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Grading is a pure total function of the case and the answer. No grader may invoke a provider, read the clock, read the filesystem or consult any model. Generated prose does not become evidence because another model agrees with it, and a majority of models agreeing produces agreement rather than evidence." <urn:usf:graph:provider-task-qualification> .
<urn:usf:requirement:grader-consults-no-model> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:Requirement> <urn:usf:graph:provider-task-qualification> .
