<urn:usf:requirement:grader-verdict-is-explicit> <urn:usf:predicate:invariant> "five distinguishable verdicts; only PASS scores; an unjudgeable case is not removed from the denominator." <urn:usf:graph:provider-task-qualification> .
<urn:usf:requirement:grader-verdict-is-explicit> <urn:usf:predicate:requirementSeverity> <urn:usf:requirement-severity:blocking> <urn:usf:graph:provider-task-qualification> .
