<urn:usf:requirement:grader-verdict-is-explicit> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "A grader returns one of PASS, FAIL, REFUSAL, INAPPLICABLE or INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE, with a machine-readable diagnostic naming which of them and why. Only PASS scores. A case that could not be judged remains in the denominator, because excluding it would raise the score of a suite that failed to ask the question." <urn:usf:graph:provider-task-qualification> .
<urn:usf:requirement:grader-verdict-is-explicit> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:Requirement> <urn:usf:graph:provider-task-qualification> .
